# Upload context for `gcloud builds submit`. Deliberately NOT derived from .gitignore: its `lib/`
# pattern (Python build artifacts) would also drop frontend/lib/, which the Next.js build needs.
.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
frontend/out
deployment/helm/pipeshub-ai/charts
